        <mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;b&gt;FreshVend — State Diagram đơn hàng (TV3 Sales)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Luồng chính: PENDING → PAID → DISPENSED&lt;br&gt;Lỗi nhả hàng: PAID → DISPENSE_FAILED → REFUNDED&lt;br&gt;Hết hạn: PENDING (quá 5 phút) → EXPIRED&lt;br&gt;Trạng thái cuối: DISPENSED, EXPIRED, REFUNDED — không quay lại PAID." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
